\"nofollow\">機械動力甜點工坊</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">機械動力工藝與附加</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇幻生物誌</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crock-pot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">燉鍋烹飪</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/croptopia-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">作物天堂</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">循環科技</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delicate-and-dainty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精緻小品</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/drop-the-meat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">肉塊掉落</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/druidcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">德魯伊工藝</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/edible-bugs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">可食用昆蟲</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eidolon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻象秘典</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endergetic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">終界激擴</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endless-ocean-adventures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">無盡海洋：冒險篇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhanced-mushrooms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">強化蘑菇生態</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">環境物語</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/evilcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">邪惡工藝</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exotic-birds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">異域鳥類</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">擴展洞穴</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-food-recipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">額外食物食譜</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-foods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">額外食物</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasy-mounts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻想坐騎</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fins-and-tails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鰭尾水族</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fluffys-farming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">弗拉菲的農場</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/food-expansion-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">食物擴展：重塑版</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/foragecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">採集工藝</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">禁忌秘法</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frozen-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰封世界</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fruit-trees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">果樹物語</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fruitful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">碩果累累</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gaia-dimension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蓋亞次元</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gilded-ingot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鍍金錠</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gingerkes-drinks-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">金格的飲品+</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glow-bats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">熒光蝙蝠</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-beetroot-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">黃金甜菜根模組</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/good-nights-sleep\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">安眠之夜</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/greek-fantasy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">希臘幻想</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火：龍之傳說</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸烹飪</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-berries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">改良漿果</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infernal-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地獄擴張</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inspirations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">靈感源泉</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-dynamics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">集成動力</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/krays-magic-candles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">克雷的魔法蠟燭</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/meet-your-fight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">宿命對決</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mowzies-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">莫西的生物</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-world\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘世界</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">那不勒斯風情</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neoelfeos-medieval-pub-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">奈夫的中世紀酒館裝飾</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-soups-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地獄湯羹模組</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地獄佳餚</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nourished-end\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">終界饗宴</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nourished-nether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地獄饗宴</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/odd-water-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇異水生生物</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生態奇航</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/omni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">萬象之境</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-crops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">潘氏的收穫工藝2：作物篇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-food-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">潘氏的收穫工藝2：核心食物</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-food-extended\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">潘氏的收穫工藝2：擴展食物</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-trees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">潘氏的收穫工藝2：樹木篇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pandoras-creatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">潘朵拉的生物</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/peculiars\" target=\"_<p>請透過在<a href=\"https://github.com/TheIllusiveC4/Diet/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤系統</a>上開啟問題來請求支援，或開啟拉取請求以直接貢獻。</p>",
